ER seen a t0-window crop -- the ONLY geometry this live pipeline can ever produce at forecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-08-13 20:10:26.809854+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-08-13 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-08-14 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-08-13 18:03:41+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":5,"degraded_history":false,"containment_pct":3,"acres_wfigs":88421.65124924152,"hour":18,"valid_at_utc":"2026-08-13 18:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-119.99999,39.74091],[-119.99964,39.74091],[-119.99964,39.74064],[-119.99999,39.74064],[-119.99999,39.74091]]],[[[-119.99894,39.74387],[-119.99859,39.74387],[-119.99859,39.7436],[-119.99894,39.7436],[-119.99894,39.74387]]],[[[-119.99719,39.74522],[-119.99683,39.74522],[-119.99683,39.74495],[-119.99719,39.74495],[-119.99719,39.74522]]],[[[-119.99824,39.7463],[-119.99859,39.7463],[-119.99859,39.74603],[-119.99929,39.74603],[-119.99929,39.7463],[-119.99964,39.7463],[-119.99964,39.74657],[-119.99929,39.74657],[-119.99929,39.74684],[-119.99859,39.74684],[-119.99859,39.74657],[-119.99824,39.74657],[-119.99824,39.7463]]],[[[-119.99894,39.74899],[-119.99929,39.74899],[-119.99929,39.74872],[-120.00034,39.74872],[-120.00034,39.74899],[-120.00069,39.74899],[-120.00069,39.74926],[-120.00104,39.74926],[-120.00104,39.74953],[-119.99999,39.74953],[-119.99999,3